  "content": "<table style=\"width:100%\">\n  <tbody><tr>\n    <td style=\"width:124px;text-align:center\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex\">\n        <img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/zipestudio.png?raw=true\">\n      </div>\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      <div style=\"display:flex\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/TalkingHeads\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n            <img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/github.png?raw=true\">\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fTalkingHeads\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n            <img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/modrinth.png?raw=true\">\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/TalkingHeads\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n            <img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/curseforge.png?raw=true\">\n          </a>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex\">\n          <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fXmGF7rkkuY\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n            <img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/discord.png?raw=true\">\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ft.me%252fzipeleaf\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n            <img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/telegram.png?raw=true\">\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fzipestudio%252ftip\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n            <img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/support.png?raw=true\">\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table><p><img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/ZSdescription.png?raw=true\" alt=\"&quot;描述&quot; 标题\"></p><p><strong>Talking Heads</strong> 是一款客户端插件，可以在玩家说话时放大其头颅。<br>\n完全兼容 <strong>Plasmo Voice</strong> 和 <strong>Simple Voice Chat</strong>，并且可以同时使用两者！</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/TalkingHeads/blob/master/img/showcase.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"&quot;Talking Heads 横幅&quot;\"></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/ZSsupport.png?raw=true\" alt=\"&quot;支持&quot; 标题\"></p><h3>想要支持模组和作者吗？只需向所有人介绍这个模组！</h3><p>是的，你没听错。仅通过宣传，你就能很好地支持模组和创作者。了解这个模组的人越多，下载量就越大，更多下载量将给予作者良好动力，并增加网站收入（相当于免费捐助）。<strong>请记住，宣传不能打扰别人或让人厌烦！</strong></p><h3>你能做什么？</h3><ul>\n<li>制作视频评测/广告</li>\n<li>在社交媒体或 Discord 上分享</li>\n<li>告诉你的朋友这个模组</li>\n<li>将其加入你的整合包，或直接下载并享受游戏</li>\n</ul><blockquote>\n  <p>每一次提及都很重要——感谢你帮助社区成长 🤍</p>\n</blockquote><p><img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/ZSlicensing.png?raw=true\" alt=\"&quot;许可&quot; 标题\"></p><h3><a href=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/TalkingHeads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">查看原模组仓库</a></h3>",
